{n})={\\prod }_{i=1}^{n}f({x}_{i};\\,\\theta ).\n$$\n\nIn our case, we are given a sample of $n=8$ independent exponential random variables with unknown parameter $\\theta ,$ for which the probability density function is\n\n$$\nf(x;\\theta )=\\theta {e}^{-\\theta x},\\,x\\ge 0.\n$$\n\nWe can calculate the likelihood function as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(\\theta ) & ={\\prod }_{i=1}^{n}\\theta {e}^{-\\theta {x}_{i}} \\\\  & ={\\theta }^{n}\\,{e}^{-\\theta \\sum {x}_{i}} \\\\  & ={\\theta }^{n}\\,{e}^{-S\\theta }\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $S={\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}.$ \n\nWe are told that $S={\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}=1$ and $n=8.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(\\theta ) & ={\\theta }^{8}\\,{e}^{-\\theta }.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f54d81db-e00f-5ac6-9f0a-0c0bda93c977"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f54d81db-e00f-5ac6-9f0a-0c0bda93c977" :answer-field/id #uuid "f54d81db-e00f-5ac6-9f0a-0c0bda93c977" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8ff0b119-2b3f-582b-99fc-7d672cb6d196" :answer-field/choices ["answer-63cf22b5-7f93-5e24-9448-1d7bad4ce711" "answer-efd47b38-13e1-5245-8185-b3fac3d1133d" "answer-b84e19ff-9bd4-5491-9bde-913dac16b81e" "answer-8ff0b119-2b3f-582b-99fc-7d672cb6d196" "answer-1493f427-3ec7-524c-9d7f-9e81ca26eed7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-63cf22b5-7f93-5e24-9448-1d7bad4ce711" :answer/id #uuid "63cf22b5-7f93-5e24-9448-1d7bad4ce711" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\theta \\,{e}^{-8\\theta }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-efd47b38-13e1-5245-8185-b3fac3d1133d" :answer/id #uuid "efd47b38-13e1-5245-8185-b3fac3d1133d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\theta \\,{e}^{-\\theta }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b84e19ff-9bd4-5491-9bde-913dac16b81e" :answer/id #uuid "b84e19ff-9bd4-5491-9bde-913dac16b8